  "prefLabel": "Ath 406.07 Obligation to Cooperate with Investigations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ath 406.07 Obligation to Cooperate with Investigations. Licensees shall cooperate with the OPLC’s investigations by:\n\n(a) Providing accurate factual information;\n\n(b) Responding to the OPLC’s requests in a timely fashion; and\n\n(c) Assisting in any other way requested by the OPLC.\n\nSource. #9099, eff 3-1-08; renumbered by #10228, (from Ath 405.08); ss by #10921, eff 8-29-15 (from Ath 406.08); ss by #14247, eff 5-16-25, EXPIRES: 5-16-35",
